e"},{"text":", the version every event of it names: each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"version of an event is a breaking change, a SchemaVer MODEL. The newest version of the event","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in ","type":"text"},{"code":"committed","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"N-0-k","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", is compared with the event by what the two mean, as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/check(against:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" compares a plan, not by their bytes:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When nothing differs, the file returned is the committed one, byte for byte, however it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is formatted."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When a difference is breaking ("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanDifference\/isBreaking","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"), the export throws"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/IgluExportError\/breakingChange(event:version:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":": a payload the published schema accepts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"could fail the new one, which Iglu publishes only as a new MODEL, so raise the event’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"version."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When every difference is compatible (an optional or defaulted property added, a property"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"removed, a constraint loosened), it is an ADDITION. For "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/IgluRegistry\/server","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" the file"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"returned is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"N-0-(k+1)"},{"type":"text","text":", which lists every earlier "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"N-0-*"},{"type":"text","text":" in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"$supersedes"},{"type":"text","text":", so Snowplow"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"validates events naming "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"N-0-0"},{"type":"text","text":" against it; it keeps the properties of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"N-0-k"},{"type":"text","text":" the event"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no longer declares, marked "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"deprecated"},{"type":"text","text":" and not required, as "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/files(carryingForward:)","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeps them. A static repository doesn’t supersede, so for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/IgluRegistry\/staticRepository","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" the export throws"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/IgluExportError\/additionNeedsNewVersion(event:version:)","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" instead."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Throws","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/IgluExportError\/invalidVendor"},{"type":"text","text":" for a vendor that isn’t one;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/IgluExportError\/invalidSchemaKey(eve